{"sourceUrl":"http://www.mse.neu.edu.cn/2025/0630/c9489a288665/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:48.861840+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.mse.neu.edu.cn/2025/0630/c9489a288665/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>为帮助考生深入了解我院研究生教育特色、招生政策及培养优势等情况，学院将开展</span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年研究生招生宣传活动，通过线上线下相结合的方式，为同学们提供全方位咨询服务。现将具体安排通知如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、</span></span><span>线上宣传活动</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span>直播宣讲会：院长、学科带头人</span><span><span>等</span></span><span>将在线解读招生政策、专业特色、导师团队及就业前景</span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>时间</span><span><span>安排</span></span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span><span>上午；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>平台：学校官网、微信公众号、抖音</span><span><span>/B</span><span>站官方号（支持回放）</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>二、线下宣传活动</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span>校园开放日：参观</span><span><span>校园学习生活</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>聆听学术讲座、</span></span><span>与导师面对面交流</span><span><span>等</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>为保证活动效果，参加线下活动的外校优秀学生人数不超过</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>40</span></span><span><span>人，基本申请条件如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>全日制</span></span><span>应届本科毕业生</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>本科期间学习成绩优秀，</span><span><span>预计可获得</span></span><span>推荐</span><span><span>免试资格</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>）本科专业包括</span><span><span>材料、冶金、物理、化学等</span></span><span>相关专业</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）原则上通过国家大学外语四级考试（四级成绩达到</span><span><span>425</span><span>分以上）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>2.</span></strong></span></span><span><span><strong><span>报名程序。符合申请条件，有意向参加线下活动</span></strong></span></span><span><span>的同学可以在</span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>30</span></span><span>日—</span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span>通过扫描下方二维码填写申请信息（扫描前请通过官方网站下载钉钉</span></span></span><span><span><span>APP</span></span><span><span>），学院将按照审核规则对报名同学进行资格初审，初审合格的同学将于</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日收到短信通知，收到短信后请按短信通知内容按时操作，逾期未反馈的，将视为放弃活动资格。</span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/428c3522698ae9cb2cab.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>3.</span></strong></span></span><span><span><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></span></span></span><br/></p><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日下午  报到（报到地点另行通知）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日上午  招生宣讲</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日下午  参观校园，学术交流，返程</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong><span>注：</span></strong></span></span><span><span>最终行程安排详见活动当天会序手册。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>三、其它</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）我院为</span><span><span>全体同学</span></span><span>统一安排用餐，外校</span><span><span>同学安排</span></span><span>住宿。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（二）就读沈阳市以外高校</span></span><span><span>同学</span></span><span><span>，若最终</span></span><span><span>确认录取我校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生</span></span><span><span>可报销</span></span><span><span>活动期间</span></span><span><span>往返路费，</span></span><span><span>入学后统一办理报销事宜</span></span><span><span>，限火车硬座</span></span></span><span><span>/</span><span>硬卧、高铁</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>动车二等座</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>最终报销将按我校计划财经处规定执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）学院将为</span><span><span>全体同学</span></span><span>办理活动期间人身意外保险，在</span><span><span>学术交流日</span></span><span>活动期间因个人行为导致的意外事故及产生的医疗费用，由</span><span><span>其</span></span><span>本人承担。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>考生如有意向在上述活动日程（线下活动）外参观东北大学校园，可在学校开放的出入口（</span></span><span><span><strong><span>南湖校区开放南门、北门、西门；浑南校区开放东门、西门</span></strong></span></span><span><span>）刷取本人身份证出入校园，驾车出入校园的可通过关注“平安东北大学”，依次点击入校预约</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>校外车辆入校备案，填写相关信息履行备案程序即可驾车出入校园。校园限速</span></span></span><span><span><span>25km/h</span></span><span><span>，请注意交通安全。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>四、联系渠道</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：</span><span><span>王</span></span><span>老师</span></span></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>024-836</span><span><span>71987</span></span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><span><span>wangwanqiu</span></span><span>@</span><span><span>mail.neu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系部门：</span><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></span><span>教学科研办公室</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>办公地点：</span><span><span>南湖校区知行楼</span></span></span></span><span><span>422</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本方案解释权属东北大学</span><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span><span>学院。</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>相关链接：</span></strong></span></p><p><span>东北大学研究生招生信息网：</span><span><span>http://yz.neu.edu.cn/</span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></span><span>网站：</span></span></span><span>http://www.mse.neu.edu.cn/</span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.mse.neu.edu.cn/2025/0630/c9489a288665/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>愿广大</span><span><span>同学</span></span><span>通过本次</span><span><span>学术交流日</span></span><span>活动了解东北大学，了解东北大学</span><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span><span>学院，感受白山黑水的校园环境和深厚的人文底蕴。欢迎广大优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>东北大学</span><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span><span>学院</span></span></span></p><p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>6</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"8a425ad2e4eb3286000ed93aa436b3774a0ee79160fbb36271f83616e6f95ad4","textLength":1282,"sourceSha256":"3d2c290a785d96a801a5da3416dc818416bbe0d742a754f9e126b98d58b2ac06","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-11f5421003b9a474280b","title":"2025年东北大学材料科学与工程学院2025年研究生招生宣传活动周的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:48.861840+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.mse.neu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/ee/77/02e4507a4af4b43541c9ac106170/623c0f46-fce1-478c-8b2c-b3d0b57f095f.png","file":"assets/articles/media/428c3522698ae9cb2cab.png"}]}
